Releasing this project under an open-source license is a decision for later,
once it has a stable release and its public interface has settled. To make it,
replace this file with `LICENSE-MIT` (or another OSI-approved license), set the
README's license name and badge to match, and commit the change on its own so
it reads as a release note. The copyright holder owns all contributions, so no
contributor consent is needed for the switch.
